WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.081
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.747 --> 00:00:05.681
Cody wants to reach more logistics companies like Northfield.

3
00:00:06.496 --> 00:00:08.523
Let's see how Centaur's Copywriter helps.

4
00:00:09.457 --> 00:00:11.943
Cody builds a four step outreach sequence.

5
00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:14.844
He doesn't have to write four perfect emails.

6
00:00:15.832 --> 00:00:18.592
For each step, he writes a line on what it should do.

7
00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:19.858
Introduce us.

8
00:00:20.221 --> 00:00:21.068
Share a result.

9
00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:22.905
Ask for twenty minutes.

10
00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:24.890
Check in one last time.

11
00:00:26.122 --> 00:00:28.398
Then he adds forty people to the sequence.

12
00:00:29.126 --> 00:00:33.002
When a step is due, the Copywriter writes a fresh email for each person.

13
00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.120
It uses their role, their company and their industry.

14
00:00:38.055 --> 00:00:41.814
A head of operations at a freight firm gets a different email from a finance

15
00:00:41.814 --> 00:00:43.447
director at a warehouse business.

16
00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:45.992
It only says what's true.

17
00:00:46.684 --> 00:00:51.405
About your product, it uses your own description from AI Training, nothing more.

18
00:00:52.586 --> 00:00:55.131
About the person, it uses what's on their record,

19
00:00:55.131 --> 00:00:57.830
and never invents facts about them or their company.

20
00:00:58.956 --> 00:01:01.812
If someone replies, their sequence stops straight away,

21
00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:04.876
so nobody gets a scripted follow-up after they've answered.

22
00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:07.548
The conversation goes back to Cody.

23
00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:10.264
And nothing goes out without Cody.

24
00:01:11.094 --> 00:01:15.324
Every email waits in AI Activity for him to read, edit and approve.

25
00:01:16.098 --> 00:01:19.844
And Centaur never emails anyone who has unsubscribed, bounced,

26
00:01:19.844 --> 00:01:21.657
or been marked do not contact.

27
00:01:23.212 --> 00:01:24.323
Centaur CRM.

28
00:01:25.169 --> 00:01:28.374
Forty personal emails, without writing forty emails.

29
00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:32.777
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

